# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Sondas de servicio cruzado (biber negada en prometeo, biber negada en matomo, dishboard tile alcanzaability) NO son parte del biber persona per-role. Viven en la propia especificaciones del proveedor (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrizado una vez sobre el proveedor `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifiesto. Para el dashboard, el escenario parametrado delegados a `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, que posee la visibilidad del azulejo / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" afirmaciones pop-out en un SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Las sondas de servicio cruzado no forman parte de la persona administradora per-role. La posibilidad de llegar a las baldosas es propiedad de `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, que delega el cuerpo per-objetivo al `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (azulejos visible → clic cargas en `#main iframe` → encabezado \"Tab\" botón emerge la incrustación en una pestaña del navegador fresco). Ese ayudante es el SPOT para los mecánicos dashboard-tile; las especificaciones del consumidor NO DEBE reelaborar ninguna de esas afirmaciones. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity son propiedad de `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Cada proveedor parametraliza la afirmación sobre su `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifiesto."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Afirmaciones de la superficie de servicio cruzado (dishboard tile alcanzabilidad, prometheus admin-reach y raspar la paridad, matomo admin-reach y seguimiento presencia, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) son propiedad de la propia especificaciones del proveedor. Cada proveedor parametraliza la afirmación sobre su `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifiesta, hecha a través `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Las personas de los papeles del consumidor NO deben duplicar estas sondas."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-stack connectivity"
msgstr "Conectividad entre bastidores"

