msgstr "El set pasó al escenario 2 es construido por el planificador de matriz: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) y [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) llamada `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` dentro [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), que resuelve cada ronda incluye a través `_resolve_round_include` dentro [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) usando el [CombinadoResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) con `follow_run_after=False`. El camino de prueba de enjambre compute su incluye por separado [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), leer el mapa de la variante activa `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Ambos expanden la selección a lo largo de dos caminos transitivos:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The index is rebuilt on every run so it cannot drift from what is on disk: a manually deleted index gets restored, and a stale link to a removed archive gets dropped. The function stays byte-idempotent: when the resulting content matches what is already on disk, the file is not rewritten."
