msgid "The override path is host-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. The inventory mirror step (see [mirror.md](mirror.md)) writes there automatically; manual overrides go to the same key."
msgstr "El camino es host-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. The inventory mirror step (ver [mirror.md](mirror.md)) escribe allí automáticamente; las anulaciones manuales van a la misma clave."

