# libretranslate
msgid "The per-category port ranges that the suggester proposes from and that the lint check enforces live as a single `PORT_BANDS` map in [08_networks.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). Suggesters and lint pick up new entries automatically, with no second registration step. See `cli contributing network ports suggest` in [port.md](../../../tools/network/port.md)."
msgstr "Los rangos de puertos per-categoría que el sugerente propone y que el control de lint ejecute viven como un solo `PORT_BANDS` mapa en [08networks.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). Sugerentes y lint recogen nuevas entradas automáticamente, sin un segundo paso de registro. Véase `cli contributing network ports suggest` dentro [port.md](../../../tools/network/port.md)."

