# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "El papel despliega un solo ``registry:2`` instancia en el modo proxy de paso en el anfitrión de su grupo de inventario. Porque el grupo normalmente tiene exactamente un anfitrión (el gerente enano), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resuelve ``compose`` para el papel; el fan-out multi-host para el cache en sí está fuera de alcance para v1."

