# libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured ``msmtprc`` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated ``msmtp-mta`` package, it configures a direct ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` compatibility symlink to ``msmtp``."
msgstr "El papel se instala **msmtp**, maneja diferencias de paquetes específicas (incluido EPEL bootstrap en el host EL-familia cuando sea necesario), e implementa un preconfigurado ``msmtprc`` archivo vía Jinja2. Para distros sin un dedicado ``msmtp-mta`` paquete, configura un paquete directo ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` compatibilidad de enlace a ``msmtp``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured `msmtprc` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated `msmtp-mta` package, it configures a direct `/usr/bin/sendmail` compatibility symlink to `msmtp`."
