# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar creates its consumer's bucket itself at startup because a swarm stack's converge gate blocks before any post-deploy task could create it, deadlocking consumers that hard-fail on a missing bucket (e.g. the OpenTalk controller). The stock entrypoint routes every argv through ``weed`` (``sh`` as a command would become ``weed sh``), so the template overrides it with ``sh -c``; the server itself is still launched via ``/entrypoint.sh`` to keep its /data chown, privilege drop, and default server args."
msgstr "El sidecar crea el cubo de su consumidor en la puesta en marcha porque una pila de enjambre converge bloques de puertas antes de que cualquier tarea post-deploy pudiera crearlo, desconcertante consumidores que duro-fail en un cubo perdido (por ejemplo OpenTalk controlador). El punto de entrada de las acciones recorre cada argv a ``weed`` (``sh`` como un comando se convertiría en ``weed sh``), por lo que la plantilla lo invalida ``sh -c``; el servidor en sí sigue siendo lanzado ``/entrypoint.sh`` para mantener su /data chown, caída de privilegios y args servidor predeterminado."

# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar is never routed publicly. A bearerless probe of `/mcp` on the public vhost is answered with an SSO redirect, never with an MCP response."
msgstr "El sidecar nunca se encamina públicamente. Una sonda sin oso de `/mcp` on the public vhost is answered with an SSO redirect, never with an MCP response."

