# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) on Arch Linux systems. GCC is a standard compiler suite supporting C, C++, and other programming languages. It is a core component for compiling and building software from source."
msgstr "Este papel Ansible instala la colección GNU Compiler (GCC) en sistemas Arch Linux. GCC es una suite compiladora estándar que apoya C, C++ y otros idiomas de programación. Es un componente básico para compilar y construir software de la fuente."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the Intel VA-API media driver for the current Linux distribution."
msgstr "Este papel Ansible instala el Intel VA-API controlador multimedia para la distribución actual de Linux."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "Este papel Ansible instala el [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) cliente de escritorio en sistemas Arch Linux usando el [AUR (Arch User Repositorio)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."
msgstr "Este papel Ansible instala el `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ cliente de escritorio en sistemas Arch Linux usando el `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It's particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Este papel de Ansible es responsable de instalar GnuCash, un software de gestión financiera libre y de código abierto, sobre sistemas que utilizan el administrador de paquetes Pacman. Es particularmente útil para establecer GnuCash en un entorno Linux con mínima intervención manual."

# libretranslate
