# libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: compostura ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; enano ``<entity>:<internal>`` (alias compartidos) para el apéndice, o ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` para coches laterales nombrados (sso-proxy)A ``host_gateway`` app ejecuta node-local bajo enjambre y publica su puerto local al host, por lo que el proxy adjunto lo alcanza en ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` a través de la puerta de recepción (el callador pone esto fuera de lo real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, ya que tales aplicaciones fuerzan un render de estilo compositivo)Desaparecidos puertos internos enjambres."

