# libretranslate
msgid "Verify in a swarm cluster that the `force_bridge` upstream actually reaches the gateway: openresty resolves `host.docker.internal` to the host gateway, while `svc-ai-litellm` publishes `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. On a real host `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` is `127.0.0.1`, and the assumption is that `docker stack deploy` drops the bind IP from the short port syntax and publishes on all interfaces via the routing mesh. If that assumption fails, publish the gateway port in host mode (long syntax) or give openresty a `litellm` consumer flag instead."
msgstr "Verificar en un grupo enjambre que el `force_bridge` arriba realmente llega a la puerta de entrada: la apertura resuelve `host.docker.internal` a la puerta de acogida, mientras `svc-ai-litellm` publica `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. En un verdadero anfitrión `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` es `127.0.0.1`, y la suposición es que `docker stack deploy` drops the bind IP from the short port syntax and publishes on all interfaces via the routing mesh. Si esa suposición falla, publicar el puerto de la puerta de entrada en modo host (sintaxis larga) o dar apertura a `litellm` bandera de consumo en su lugar."

