# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "SUELDOS no tiene SSO nativo; la sesión de administración está acuñada del oauth2- el encabezado de identidad proxy por el ``shunt_is_valid_user`` ingresos ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona permanece en vivo y ejerce el puente final a fin."

# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "SUELDOS no tiene SSO nativo; la sesión de administración está acuñada del oauth2- el encabezado de identidad proxy por el `shunt_is_valid_user` ingresos [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), que honra el encabezado sólo en el camino de administración cerrada y sólo para los miembros del YOURLS grupo administrador. La puerta en sí admite sólo que el mismo grupo RBAC ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), entonces `biber` es rechazado antes YOURLS Hace cualquier cosa: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Declaraciones `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, y la negación se afirma explícitamente por `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. El `administrator` persona permanece en vivo y ejerce el puente final a fin."

