msgid "`tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` therefore rewrites `curlsecurityblockedhosts` to `MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS` and extends `curlsecurityallowedport` with the port of `MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT` when the `litellm` service is enabled. Loopback, `0.0.0.0` and the cloud metadata address stay blocked; the RFC1918 ranges are opened. The Docker address pool and the bridge gateway that serves the pinned Keycloak authority both live inside them."
